window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The gods are here. Time to expand or be consumed.</p> <p>With the gods now aware of his existence, a desperate Smit finds a sliver of hope that could help him survive—a long forgotten entity, more ancient than the Ascended themselves. Yet searching for it sends him closer to the abyss and the demons that wait within.</p> <p>Gathering his allies, Smit must dive into the unknown dungeon and guide his creatures against his own kin. If he fails in this dangerous gamble for his survival, Smit will find himself subdued forevermore as a slave to the new gods.</p> <p>If he succeeds, he’ll be one step closer to ascending to godhood himself…</p>"; 
